<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24439" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">interrŏgātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				questioning</i>, <i>inquiry</i>, <i>examination</i>, <i>interrogation</i> (class.).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sententia per interrogationem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint.
					8, 5, 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">instare interrogatione,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					6, 3, 38</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">testium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. A.
					6, 47</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">insidiosa,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					Ep. 1, 5, 7</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">litteris inclusae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig. 48, 3, 6, § 1</span></i>
			.— <b>
				<i>Absol.</i>
			</b>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Fam. 1, 9, 7</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Quint. 5, 7,
				3</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">verbis obligatio fit ex interrogatione et
					responsione,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gai. Inst. 2, 92</span></i>
			. — </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			In partic. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b> As rhet.
			fig., <i><span class="en">Quint. 9, 2, 15</span></i>; <i><span class="en">9, 3,
			98</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>A syllogism</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">recte genus hoc interrogationis ignavum ac
					iners nominatum est,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Fat. 13</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 87 <i>med.</i></span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
